          <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg mb-8 max-w-3xl">Berlin is the only major German city with 12 independent borough building offices. Depending on the site, LAGeSo (BSL-3), the hospital building office and the Berlin fire directorate can also be competent for a container laboratory. We communicate with all of them — you do not.</p>
