              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">BauO Bln – building notification and borough procedure</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">The Berlin Building Code (Bauordnung Berlin, BauO Bln) is decisive. Permit-exempt works and the building notification apply depending on size — we check the classification of your site in advance and submit review-ready building documents to the competent borough office. Mitte, Pankow, Treptow-Köpenick and Charlottenburg-Wilmersdorf each review according to their own practice.</p>
