              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">BSL-3 in Berlin requires a permit under BioStoffV (federal law) plus a notification to LAGeSo — Berlin’s state office for health and social affairs. For genetic-engineering facilities S1/S2/S3 an additional notification under GenTG is required. We supply the risk assessment, safety concept and complete application documents.</p>
